::MODULE{FIELDS|title:Normalized offer fields}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at provider

::RULE{Only publish offers supported by text or structured data fetched from the provider URL}
::RULE{Missing price means omit price and priceCurrency from JSON-LD}
::RULE{Past valid_until means mark expired and keep it out of active lists}
::RULE{Respect robots.txt, timeouts, and one request per provider per run}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 绕过登录或反爬|scope=permanent}

::MODULE{RENDER|title:Static rendering rules}
  Generate index, provider, deal, compare, sitemap and robots from offers.json
  Generate canonical, Open Graph, Twitter card and JSON-LD on every page
  Use fetched_at for sitemap lastmod and display source links for provenance
  Locale en-US, currency USD when a provider page exposes a dollar amount

::STATE{@UPDATE, frequency:every 6 hours, runtime:GitHub Actions, output:site/}
